        <h1>Imprimir etiquetas</h1><p>`+n[x(2758)]+x(1822)+(n.length>1?"s":"")+(c[x(3630)]?x(463)+t(c[x(3630)]):"")+x(3446)+L("imprimir")+x(2319)+L(x(1257))+x(1403)+L(x(1092))+x(1167)+(/^(localhost|127\.|192\.168\.)/[x(655)](location.hostname)?x(3107)+L(x(1092))+x(1821)+t(location[x(3145)])+x(976):"")+x(1077)+_(Object[x(1630)](Qx)[x(2119)](([I,j])=>({valor:I,texto:j.nombre})),y[x(2320)])+`
